{"id":"n48551-1-9","stage":2,"title":"동아리 · 社团","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48551-1-9-1","ko":"너는 무슨 동아리에 들 거야?","zh":"你打算加入哪个社团呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동아리에","meaning":"社团，协会","explanation":"동아리：社团，协会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"동아리","audio":"/audio/d3841f62249f457a52e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48551","senseId":"1","lemma":"동아리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들","meaning":"入，加入","explanation":"들다：入，加入；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"14","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"d3841f62249f457a","term":"동아리","zh":"社团，协会","audio":"/audio/d3841f62249f457a52e2.mp3","entryId":"48551","definition":"爱好或意向相同的人们的聚会。","pronunciation":["동아리"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"入，加入"