：苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","readings":[{"term":"고민","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19225","senseId":"1","lemma":"고민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중이야.","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ee488a636544e5f4","term":"농구","zh":"篮球","audio":"/audio/ee488a636544e5f46302.mp3","entryId":"28323","definition":"两支五人队伍之间进行的比赛，在对方的篮筐中投球更多的队伍获胜。","pronunciation":["농구"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"d3841f62249f457a","term":"동아리","zh":"社团，协会","audio":"/audio/d3841f62249f457a52e2.mp3","entryId":"48551","definition":"爱好或意向相同的人们的聚会。","pronunciation":["동아리"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"加入，进入","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"成为某团体的一员。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"2d27a95090cbb680","term":"고민","zh":"苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3","entryId":"19225","definition":"心里有烦心事而痛苦，一直在意。","pronunciation":["고민"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"处在某状态的期间。","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"处在某状态的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]}],"audio":"/audio/5489d4abbf6bab9ef2a0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.587,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=48551","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2404,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为我喜欢篮球，